      "value": "Can confirm that this happened to me while testing a world. I didn’t know why this happened at the time, but seeing you post about this and mentioning “when someone switched to an avatar with many audio sources” made me remember that this bug happened as soon as someone in my world switched avatars. All world audio cut off entirely.",
